<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN NMKN/SNCI TO CUT INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN NMKN/SNCI TO CUT INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian industrial credit bank</p>
<p>NMKN/SNCI said on Tuesday it would cut it investment credit</p>
<p>rates as follows from December 4.</p>
<p>    MATURITY			NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    three year revisable	5.55 pct	5.70 pct</p>
<p>    five year revisable	 6.40 pct	6.60 pct</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
